# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
terraform.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT ignored. It pins provider versions and their checksums,
# so CI resolves the same providers this machine did. Ignoring it means a provider release can
# silently change what `terraform plan` reports.

# Credentials — nothing in this repo should ever hold a key
*.json.key
service-account*.json
*-key.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Kubernetes
kubeconfig
*.kubeconfig

# Generated diagrams. The rendered architecture SVG is committed — the website embeds it, and CI
# keeps it in sync with the D2 source.
diagrams/out/*
!diagrams/out/architecture.svg

# Generated ops snapshot. Holds an email address and a full account inventory, and this repo is
# meant to go public — it is a local dashboard, not portfolio content.
docs/inventory.html

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
